Package: droidshield
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-rich, adb
Description: defensive Android malware triage and incident-response toolkit
 DroidShield is a defensive Android security toolkit for authorized
 devices. It collects evidence over ADB, analyzes installed packages
 and APK artifacts, produces forensic reports, and provides guarded
 remediation workflows.
